WEBVTT

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.540
First, you only get 12 hours.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:52.200
Second, follow my lead
and change nothing.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.410
Third...

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.250
...past or future...

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.580
...just let them be.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.750
Well, all right, I got it.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.160
You've repeated this a thousand times.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.660
Gear up.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.540
Dive!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.120
--Welcome, boss!
--Out for the guests!

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.450
Here comes the landlady again.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.870
Put the picture on the counter.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.160
Hey, Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.750
I'm paying your debt.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.750
But you--

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.370
--Messing around every day!
--Give it back!

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.790
Look at you, you want to be
out of business?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.620
I grew up here with my parents,

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.290
I won't go anywhere until they come back.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.660
If you want to drive me away,

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.290
I'll hang myself here,

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.450
and your father will never
get a new tenant!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.410
Childish!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.910
Idiot.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.000
He... What did he say?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.080
He said you...

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.370
Qiao Lin, show the picture.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.370
Okay, Guang Guang.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.660
Guang Guang,

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.450
do we call the little puppy wangwang?

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.700
You can learn from Lu Guang.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.080
He is younger than you, but more sensible!

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.910
Qiao Lin...

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:26.040
I wouldn't even give him a glance
except out of consideration for you.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.750
The client for the mission--

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:31.540
He hopes we can get
their core financial data

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.040
before the third quarter financial report
of Vicky Game the day after tomorrow.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.290
But this data

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.540
is supervised by their CEO alone.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.290
To avoid the hacking risk,

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.620
he never leaves the data on the system.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.250
He carries it all the time.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.790
Time is tight,

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.080
don't play the ball,

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.250
talk about the sally port.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.950
His assistant.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.200
Emma.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.950
She's the person with
the best chance to see the data.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.620
When was the last photo of her taken?

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:13.410
This one was posted to her Moments
at 10 p.m. the day before yesterday.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.330
Midnight poison!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.950
Look for opportunities here.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.450
If it doesn't work,

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.540
go back to the last week--

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.790
Financial data may not be up to date.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.040
Any chances?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.910
Yes,

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.580
but only one.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.790
First, you only get 12 hours.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:56.410
Second, follow my lead
and change nothing.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:57.450
Third...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.500
...past or future...

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.620
...just let them be.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:03.700
Well, all right, I got it.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.870
You've repeated this a thousand times.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.410
I'll get into the photo,

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.450
and you'll lead the way.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.450
Gear up.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.500
Dive!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.040
Stop!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.500
Do as I say, don't be a drama queen.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.200
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.450
I'm listening.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:38.000
Now, should I finish this spring roll?

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.660
Hold on.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:42.200
Hold on for what?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.790
Emma, come here.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.540
Okay, coming.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.950
Hey, mind your manners!

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:57.330
Mr. Zhu, I'm coming right now!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.870
How's it going, are you satisfied now?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.120
What's going on? Something bothering you?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.290
I'm okay. Just a little
lovesick for a liar.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.500
Idiot!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.500
I told you not to do that!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.000
A lie can only be solved by another!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.870
Oh?

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.410
You got a boyfriend?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.160
Do I have one?

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:28.160
No, get back on track.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.250
No.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.410
Well, Mr. Zhu, what do you want me for?

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.500
I saw your Moments just now.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.700
Take-out food again?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.540
How about a midnight snack together?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.500
No thanks, Mr. Zhu,

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.290
I specially ordered spring rolls today.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.200
Why don't you go home early?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.450
It's not easy for you to fight alone.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:52.700
Feel free to ask me anything you need.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.250
Is that okay?

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.790
Would it be improper?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.660
You've worked for me almost two years,

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:58.830
we're partners.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.620
No biggie.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.330
Mr. Zhu, can I...

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:05.750
Just let me know,

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.660
what do you want me to do?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.000
Lu Guang! What's going on now?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.580
I did what you told me,
what's the matter with him?!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.750
Calm down, repeat after me.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.200
Mr. Zhu, we are on company property.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.120
Don't get me into a fix.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.500
Mr. Zhu, we are on company property!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.540
My office,

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.660
the most private place in the company.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.660
In addition,

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.160
my PC and mobile phone are all encrypted.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.620
I have no special hobby of taking photos.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.950
So, you may rest assured.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.580
Lu!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:42.000
What you said means...

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.410
...sex!

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.790
For the mission,

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.700
be brave and meet the man.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.750
You are kidding me!

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.540
If you make one change,

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.870
more changes are needed to make up for it.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.910
Then, the history process

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.580
will be disrupted.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.750
Right now! Push him away!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.750
Sorry, Mr. Zhu, it's my phone.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.580
Whew, Auntie, you saved my life!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:14.040
Ah? Did I have the wrong number?

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.450
Mom!

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.910
It's your son, hang on!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.160
Bah, it's your daughter!

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:25.040
What a freaking time
her mother just picked.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:29.000
Mom, I'm fine, really, I'm fine.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.830
I saw your Moments.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.500
Dinner at this time?

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.750
No, this was the dinner picture.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:38.040
I sent it when I got home.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.330
Don't lie to me. Overtime again!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.500
What's more, take-out food again!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.330
Hogwash oil, stale meat!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.950
Sick sooner or later!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.870
Mom, it's the 21st century,

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.000
the take-out is very good now.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:55.250
Clean and sanitary, healthy and safe...

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:59.200
That's all for you
young people, you can't...

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.450
Well, enough, save your words.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.660
Let her finish her work and go home early.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:09.540
Honey, I told you to block your mom
when you are posting your Moments.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.580
Why did you block me?

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.580
That was a mistake.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.750
You have a fussy mom,

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.120
just don't let her see that.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.750
Talk to your boss.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:24.290
If you can't finish today, do it tomorrow.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.250
Make time to find yourself
a boyfriend. Okay?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.870
Dad, I...

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:30.700
What are you doing in the dark?!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:33.290
The materials for tomorrow's meeting
must be finished today!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.120
Okay, all right. That's all.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.870
I heard your boss just criticized you.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.410
Get back to work, bye-bye.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:40.950
Bye-bye.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:43.580
By the way,

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.290
remember to tidy up the meeting room

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.290
before the meeting at 9:00 a.m. tomorrow.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.200
Okay, Mr. Zhu.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.040
And check your colleagues' garbage
classification before you leave.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.080
Okay, sir.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.950
Just dodged a bullet,
what should I do next?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.700
You forget his words?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.040
Prepare the material.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:08.120
Don't worry, I'm here with you,
and I'll guide you.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.290
Hurry up, you must finish it
before 2 o'clock.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.080
Otherwise, the past will change
because of you.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.750
Lu Guang, I hate you.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.540
The one to hate is not me.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.080
Lu Guang,

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:37.620
she just keeps doing this day by day?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.580
We said, linger no more around the past.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.660
The final accounts meeting

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:47.500
before financial reports tomorrow
is what you need to care about.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.750
You mean the meeting at 9 o'clock a.m.?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:01.290
We must get the data before 10 o'clock.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:04.790
The last hour is the only opportunity.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.620
It's midnight, who is that?

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.160
Leave it.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.620
Wonderful...

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.750
It's hot! Careful.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.250
One shouldn't be too anxious.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.500
Sometimes you need to wait and slow down.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.330
Dad,

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.040
why don't you wait?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.370
I have rough skin, it's okay.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:20.870
Pretending, keep pretending,

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:24.160
your father dares to fight
all the danger for you.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.790
Look at this, it's all red.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:26.950
All right,

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.830
don't be womanishly fussy.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.540
I'm a big man. What a shame!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.000
Go, go, go, hurry up.
A bottle of white wine.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.700
Go by yourself.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.580
I'm busy with a pot of soup.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.000
Dad...

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.290
Mom...

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.830
So you woke up.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.500
I dreamed about eating
spring rolls with my parents.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.120
You kept that in your mind?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.540
I'm not the only one.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.080
When you become her,
you will also inherit her feelings

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.500
and memories.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.620
Will they come back?

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.830
All right, go to sleep.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.700
You, too.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:53.950
Good night.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.160
Girl, are you home?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.370
I heard from your dad

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.200
you've been criticized by your boss
because of the call.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.580
I want to say sorry to you.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.370
When I think about whether
you're eating or sleeping well,

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.830
I feel so worried.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.580
You are the apple of our eyes.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.000
Well done.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.790
Still in the character.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.830
Get away!

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:26.000
If I got no debt to pay for the landlady,

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.830
who wants to deal with this garbage?

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.660
Garbage?

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:32.540
Many are willing do it if you're not!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:35.080
Mr. Zhu, it's not about the job.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.700
My tap broke again,
bothered me all morning.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.790
Work hard and talk less--

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.910
That's the only way to become a Phoenix

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.950
and fly out of your sparrow's nest!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.120
All right, start!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.410
Hey, Lu Guang,

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:02.910
when should we start?

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:06.950
Take it easy, they are not all there yet.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.830
He is so cunning.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:11.700
We can't see anything
because of his anti-peek film.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.250
Don't be too anxious,

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.830
calm down and be patient.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.500
Then tell me how long
I still need to wait.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.080
It's a secret.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.290
Damn it...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.250
--Right now!
--What?

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.700
Upset his cup now!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.660
You...

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.450
Whoops!

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.000
Ow...

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.330
What are you waiting for?

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.160
Go, help him clean his pants.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.000
Mr. Zhu, let me clean this for you!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.120
No, no, no, I can handle it.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.950
Well, look what we have here!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.040
Right on time.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.040
No wonder he said overtime every day,

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:07.450
so there is a bitch serving here!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:08.410
Why did you come here?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.790
You got me wrong, she is my assistant.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.700
Bullshit!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.750
Her job scope is too wide, isn't it!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:15.000
Where's your hand going?!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.910
She badgers me all the time!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.160
--Follow my lead.
--Damn...

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.910
What did you say?

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.700
I didn't do...

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.160
I've seen lots of
non-local people like you

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.290
who want to find a big tree
and just lay down in the shade.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:34.950
Your uneducated parents

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.540
should keep their wild girl
from harming others.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.080
You're such an SOB!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.750
Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:45.580
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:46.830
Don't be silly!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.540
Remember our rules!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.120
First, you only get 12 hours.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:58.200
Second, follow my lead
and change nothing.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.830
Third...

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.870
...past or future...

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.250
...just let them be!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.910
How dare you look at me in that way!

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.290
All right, all right.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:34.160
I've got all the data.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.040
Mission complete.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:42.040
Yesterday, Vicky Game was suspended
due to fraudulent financial data.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.200
Zhu and Hu involved in the case
have been arrested by the police.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.500
Are you still angry with me?

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.000
They deserve it, anyway.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.750
How cheerful is that!

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:57.450
In your opinion,

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.750
if I really did something,

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.950
will everything change because of it?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.910
Emma, you were his assistant,

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.370
it's a stain in your career.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.830
You can't find a job in this field again.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.370
I advise you to learn something else
while you are still young.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.660
Dad...

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.620
Mom...

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.330
I miss you.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.120
You didn't really do
anything stupid, did you?

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.410
Hey.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.870
Mom!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.660
My honey, why are you crying?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.830
Oh dear, I told you not to make trouble,

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.040
we have caused trouble to her again.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.620
My honey, your mother knew you miss her.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:35.200
She's really excited and wanted to
make you some spring rolls.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.370
Then she said it is cold now,
so she wants to add one more quilt,

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.830
and thick cotton padded
clothes and trousers.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.000
I said everything was
available in the city,

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.450
but she insisted that these things
were warmer from home.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.450
You take a look.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.660
Wear them at home
if you think they're too rustic.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.870
If you really don't like it,

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.080
leave it at that.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.830
No, I want them all.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.870
Can you stay please?

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.580
We're afraid to delay your work.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.660
What's going on? Baby, anyone bully you?

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:02.200
Stay where you are,
I'll be there right away!

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:06.040
I really want to know.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.500
How is she doing now?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.450
Sorry.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.540
It's okay.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.250
I heard that you are in a hurry
to get to the station.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.950
I can drive you there.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.000
Eh...

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.700
I said,

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.290
never ask about the future.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:26.160
Okay, never ask.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.450
Just kidding.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.660
--Why are you so serious?
--Welcome, boss!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:32.660
Hey, boys, meeting the guest!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:35.700
Welcome my landlady!

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.620
How can you get a new case so soon?

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:41.790
You need to make some choices,
don't bring us everything!

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:43.750
--Here comes the social events.
--You talk too much.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:45.410
--A female corpse was found
in the river last night.
--Where is Lu Guang?

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:46.580
--A female corpse was found
in the river last night.
--I'll call him.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.750
According to the police,

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:48.290
--The deceased engaged in
financial related work

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.370
--Lu Guang!
--The deceased engaged in
financial related work

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.250
in Vicky Game before her death.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.290
At present, the possibility of suicide

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:55.200
owing to her failure in the job
is not ruled out.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:58.290
Our station will make follow-up report
on any further investigation.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.040
Oh, I'm coming.
